{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras/fea76f2a7ffdc0a71ba4d82f5b8b4b7e.avif?t=1770906034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras_big/fea76f2a7ffdc0a71ba4d82f5b8b4b7e.avif?t=1770906034 width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Le Plan Spectral </strong>is a small construction video game.\u00a0\u00a0You, a dead architect, have the role of building castles to house ghosts and restore balance to the world of the living.\u00a0You are free to design the castles according to your preferences; however, each castle has certain block limitations to ensure the ghosts are welcomed in the best possible conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras/d60d0f804181dbf5caebbc4bcb15494c.avif?t=1770906034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras_big/d60d0f804181dbf5caebbc4bcb15494c.avif?t=1770906034 width=800 height=214 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this small island with your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build magnificent castles while respecting the block limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect wood and stones through mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save feature for the moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras/c4cc61b89e7ae7e5f68973caf614cb7d.avif?t=1770906034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras_big/c4cc61b89e7ae7e5f68973caf614cb7d.avif?t=1770906034 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Mode :\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to move, select, and enter building mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keyboard arrows to rotate and move the camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Mode :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to place or destroy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to switch blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;R&quot; to rotate blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keyboard arrows to rotate and move the camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Mode :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood Fishing : Use keyboard arrows to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock Fishing : Use Left Mouse or Press Space to collect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3322950?t=1770906034","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770906034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/a7ace9de72f84dc329a2e5af7ea34e095e412b34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770906034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/a7ace9de72f84dc329a2e5af7ea34e095e412b34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770906034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3324160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras/fea76f2a7ffdc0a71ba4d82f5b8b4b7e.avif?t=1770906034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras_big/fea76f2a7ffdc0a71ba4d82f5b8b4b7e.avif?t=1770906034 width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Le Plan Spectral </strong>is a small construction video game.\u00a0\u00a0You, a dead architect, have the role of building castles to house ghosts and restore balance to the world of the living.\u00a0You are free to design the castles according to your preferences; however, each castle has certain block limitations to ensure the ghosts are welcomed in the best possible conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras/d60d0f804181dbf5caebbc4bcb15494c.avif?t=1770906034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras_big/d60d0f804181dbf5caebbc4bcb15494c.avif?t=1770906034 width=800 height=214 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this small island with your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build magnificent castles while respecting the block limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect wood and stones through mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save feature for the moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras/c4cc61b89e7ae7e5f68973caf614cb7d.avif?t=1770906034\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322950/extras_big/c4cc61b89e7ae7e5f68973caf614cb7d.avif?t=1770906034 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Mode :\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to move, select, and enter building mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keyboard arrows to rotate and move the camera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 